WEBVTT

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.800
Everyone, when you're watching Deltora Quest,

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:09.400
make sure you're in a well-lit
room and sit far away from the TV!

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:24.040
You are my sun now

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:28.460
We all go through bad times

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:31.460
no matter who you are

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:36.890
So don't go hanging your head and feeling down

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:45.600
Keep your head up until your heart's sky

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:50.980
is clear again

00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:56.360
No matter where you are in this world

00:00:56.360 --> 00:00:59.870
if you're crying and trembling all alone

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:05.210
I'll search for you, I promise

00:01:05.410 --> 00:01:08.880
Love will show me the way

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:16.720
The sun dreams countless times

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:23.520
Forever and always from the horizon

00:01:24.140 --> 00:01:30.900
Its shining light gives energy

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:38.240
After all, you are my sun now

00:01:56.340 --> 00:01:58.550
<i>After taking Lief's parents hostage,</i>

00:01:58.550 --> 00:02:01.220
<i>Fallow demanded that the
Belt be handed over to him.</i>

00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:05.600
<i>But, the seven tribes fought together,</i>

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:10.810
<i>defeating Fallow and allowing
Lief to rescue Jarred and Anna.</i>

00:02:11.880 --> 00:02:17.030
<i>Doom, his memories now fully returned,
referred to Jarred as "Endon",</i>

00:02:17.030 --> 00:02:20.660
<i>revealing that Jarred is actually King Endon.</i>

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:24.950
<i>Lief was at a loss as he realised
he was the royal heir all along.</i>

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:29.540
<i>Then Fallow, seemingly back from the dead,
appeared alongside approaching Ak-Baba.</i>

00:02:57.650 --> 00:02:58.940
It's the Ak-Baba!

00:03:00.820 --> 00:03:02.700
So they've finally appeared...

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:10.300
You have nowhere left to run.

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:14.920
The Ak-Baba will once again scatter
the seven gems across the land!

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:17.760
I won't let that happen!

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:18.760
Lief.

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:21.550
There is no need to fret.

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:25.720
With the Belt of Deltora fastened
around the waist of the royal heir,

00:03:25.720 --> 00:03:29.520
not even the Ak-Baba should present a problem.

00:03:30.020 --> 00:03:33.020
That's right! I'm not afraid of those guys one bit!

00:03:38.440 --> 00:03:40.440
What's wrong, Endon?

00:03:40.440 --> 00:03:43.560
When I was enthroned as king,
you must have seen it too.

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:50.910
When the royal heir puts on the
Belt of Deltora, it will emit a blinding light.

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:57.670
That light is a sign that the Belt of Deltora
has recognised its wearer as the successor.

00:03:57.670 --> 00:04:01.170
But, that belt Lief is wearing...

00:04:03.050 --> 00:04:04.300
Indeed.

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:08.060
The light I saw from the
Belt that day was not like this.

00:04:09.350 --> 00:04:10.520
Why?

00:04:11.140 --> 00:04:13.940
Is Lief not the true heir?

00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:18.860
Or, does this mean that there
are fake gems in the Belt?

00:04:18.860 --> 00:04:24.030
That's not possible! All of the gems
we gathered are definitely real!

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:26.820
That's right.

00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:30.450
The topaz, ruby, opal, lapis lazuli;

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:33.250
we witnessed the mystical powers of each.

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:37.080
If that is so... then why?!

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:43.550
If the Belt doesn't unleash its true power,
we have no way of defeating the Shadow Lord.

00:04:43.550 --> 00:04:44.840
No.

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:47.840
Let's believe in the power of Lief and the Belt.

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:52.350
It is thanks to him that all
seven tribes have united, after all.

00:04:52.350 --> 00:04:56.020
That's right! If we all work together, we can win!

00:04:56.020 --> 00:04:59.360
Yeah! The power of the Belt doesn't matter!

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:00.440
Lief!

00:05:00.440 --> 00:05:02.110
I'm coming to help you!

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:09.620
Prin!

00:05:18.630 --> 00:05:21.250
So your intention is to kill us here, then?

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:22.590
You've done it now!

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:31.310
Stop!

00:05:31.720 --> 00:05:33.930
The Belt of Deltora is right here!

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:36.140
Keep your hands off the others!

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:37.940
I will be your opponent!

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:41.150
You're good with words, at the very least.

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:45.300
Then, as you wish, you
will be cast down to hell first!

00:06:04.130 --> 00:06:05.840
What pointless resistance.

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:07.090
Die!

00:06:17.850 --> 00:06:19.520
What's the matter?

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:22.860
Is this the best you can do with
the help of that belt of yours?

00:06:22.860 --> 00:06:23.860
Well?

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:26.780
As I suspected, you are no royal heir!

00:06:27.440 --> 00:06:29.990
You are nothing more than a sniveling child!

00:06:33.740 --> 00:06:34.740
Lief!!

00:06:42.330 --> 00:06:43.340
Glock...!

00:06:45.340 --> 00:06:46.840
Don't get distracted!

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:47.920
Thank you...

00:06:55.720 --> 00:06:58.020
Take the people somewhere safe!

00:06:58.020 --> 00:06:59.430
Understood!

00:06:59.430 --> 00:07:01.440
This way, quickly!

00:07:41.400 --> 00:07:43.400
You've reached the end of the road.

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:45.730
Where is your belt's "miracle"?

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:49.190
You damn impostor!

00:07:57.620 --> 00:07:58.450
Shit...!

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:02.330
What a stubborn boy you are.

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:05.750
Though, how long can you hang on for?

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:17.900
Looks like he's dead.

00:08:25.350 --> 00:08:26.440
Now!

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:42.040
What?!

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:50.340
Did you forget that you
accused me of being an Ol?!

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:55.970
Indeed, I am a special case, blessed by the
Shadow Lord himself; the greatest Ol of all!

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:20.580
The Belt is mine!

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:26.290
I will never let you have it!

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:40.140
Fool! I will claim you along with the Belt!

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:55.650
Curse you!!

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:02.530
With this, it's finally over.

00:10:02.530 --> 00:10:06.450
The Shadow Lord will make
his appearance very soon.

00:10:06.450 --> 00:10:12.540
You foolish humans will have no
choice but to submit to his might!

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:32.360
Damn it!

00:10:41.030 --> 00:10:41.990
You're...

00:10:42.530 --> 00:10:48.250
Have you forgotten? When truth becomes
a lie, and a lie becomes the truth.

00:10:54.130 --> 00:10:55.300
You're from that time!

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:59.170
You saved my life.

00:11:00.430 --> 00:11:03.430
I told you that I'd return the favour, didn't I?

00:11:03.930 --> 00:11:05.140
Thank you!

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:13.480
This is bad!

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:15.900
The Ak-Baba are going to
scatter the gems again...!

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:41.420
It's no use! At this rate, the
Ak-Baba will steal the gems again!

00:11:49.850 --> 00:11:51.640
The seven gems...?!

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:53.940
What's happened to Lief...?

00:12:00.230 --> 00:12:01.990
Don't let them take the gems!

00:12:16.330 --> 00:12:18.130
No... I'm not going to make it!

00:12:32.140 --> 00:12:33.140
Ri-Nan!

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:35.730
You finally came, Ri-Nan!

00:12:36.150 --> 00:12:38.020
Sorry I'm late.

00:12:38.020 --> 00:12:40.530
It took a while to prepare these.

00:13:02.340 --> 00:13:04.130
I won't allow you to take the gem!

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:06.430
It won't be like last time!

00:13:24.940 --> 00:13:26.150
Wait!

00:13:28.660 --> 00:13:31.030
You won't be taking that anywhere.

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:33.290
I will protect the gem!

00:14:35.640 --> 00:14:38.350
Where... is this...

00:14:41.350 --> 00:14:45.650
<i>The topaz has the ability to
open the door to the spirit realm.</i>

00:14:58.620 --> 00:15:00.250
Mother...!

00:15:05.920 --> 00:15:07.550
Barda...

00:15:07.550 --> 00:15:09.630
You've really grown up, haven't you?

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:11.630
Mother,

00:15:11.630 --> 00:15:12.640
I'm sorry.

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:17.060
I couldn't save you back then...

00:15:17.930 --> 00:15:20.230
It's okay, Barda.

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:23.440
You have done very well.

00:15:23.440 --> 00:15:25.730
You have nothing to apologise for.

00:15:26.440 --> 00:15:27.650
But...

00:15:28.320 --> 00:15:35.740
But if I had only listened to what
you were telling me back then...

00:15:37.330 --> 00:15:40.250
Don't dwell on past matters that can't be changed.

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:42.250
You need to live in the present.

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:44.040
Barda,

00:15:44.540 --> 00:15:48.840
you must protect that
which is precious to you now.

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:52.220
Mother...

00:15:53.340 --> 00:15:55.050
It's alright.

00:15:55.050 --> 00:15:58.720
You were always a strong boy.

00:15:58.720 --> 00:16:00.930
I know you can do it.

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:19.950
I will protect this kingdom, and my friends!

00:16:45.020 --> 00:16:46.150
Barda...!

00:16:46.520 --> 00:16:48.520
He's incredible!

00:16:53.530 --> 00:16:54.950
Don't let down your guard!

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:56.950
There are still six of them left!

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:05.040
Lief! You're alright!

00:17:08.750 --> 00:17:12.340
It doesn't matter whether
I'm the king's heir or not!

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:17.340
The seven gems are something that
everyone has been protecting with their lives!

00:17:17.340 --> 00:17:19.510
I will never let you have them!

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:22.640
Let us do our part too.

00:17:22.640 --> 00:17:28.730
We must never allow the
Shadow Lord to take the gems again.

00:17:29.360 --> 00:17:30.440
That's right.

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:46.400
Del Palace still has many
secrets yet to be revealed!

00:17:53.420 --> 00:17:54.630
Alright...!

00:18:03.430 --> 00:18:04.640
Nevets...

00:18:04.640 --> 00:18:06.060
I'll leave the rest to you...

00:18:55.650 --> 00:18:57.150
Thank you...

00:18:57.600 --> 00:19:02.950
It is remarkable to see Toran
magic exhibit such amazing power.

00:19:03.530 --> 00:19:09.460
When I am filled with the desire
to protect something dear to me,

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:14.750
my true strength manifests in that moment.

00:19:20.050 --> 00:19:21.720
Shall we also fight?

00:19:22.130 --> 00:19:26.140
Yes. The time has come to pay them back
in kind for the events of 17 years ago.

00:19:26.140 --> 00:19:28.140
We will not be defeated this time!

00:19:49.830 --> 00:19:51.620
You have improved.

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:53.040
You as well.

00:20:04.220 --> 00:20:06.850
Leave this one to me and get the Belt!

00:20:06.850 --> 00:20:07.640
Right!

00:20:27.030 --> 00:20:30.120
Without a doubt, this is the real Belt.

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:32.120
Then why?!

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:37.250
Keep at it everyone!

00:20:37.250 --> 00:20:44.050
The seven tribes are united; they trust
each other and fight together as one.

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:49.850
Then why is it that, in spite of this,
the Belt will not unleash its true power?

00:21:00.020 --> 00:21:01.440
I see...!

00:21:02.150 --> 00:21:03.940
That's it!

00:21:06.320 --> 00:21:07.030
Lief!

00:21:09.450 --> 00:21:10.450
The Belt!

00:21:14.540 --> 00:21:15.620
Lief!

00:21:15.620 --> 00:21:18.920
Set the gems back into the Belt once again!

00:21:18.920 --> 00:21:20.750
In their correct order!

00:21:20.750 --> 00:21:22.340
Their correct order...

00:21:22.340 --> 00:21:23.550
That's right.

00:21:23.550 --> 00:21:28.050
You need to arrange the
Belt's gems in the right order!

00:21:28.550 --> 00:21:31.850
That is why it couldn't unleash its power.

00:21:31.850 --> 00:21:33.720
The right order is-

00:21:36.230 --> 00:21:39.350
Foolish humans!

00:21:39.860 --> 00:21:43.150
You would have done well to remain subservient.

00:22:09.050 --> 00:22:11.760
Th-The Shadow Lord...?!

00:22:47.630 --> 00:22:53.390
I would be lying to you

00:22:53.550 --> 00:22:59.180
if I said I wasn't lonely

00:22:59.940 --> 00:23:05.730
I know I'm not being honest

00:23:06.270 --> 00:23:11.530
but I just can't put it into words

00:23:12.360 --> 00:23:18.500
It's for the sake of our dreams

00:23:20.160 --> 00:23:22.080
At this point

00:23:22.170 --> 00:23:27.800
to sing "I love you" to a faraway you

00:23:28.130 --> 00:23:34.090
my voice would simply fade into the wind

00:23:34.300 --> 00:23:40.390
In a way, that's worse than saying "goodbye"

00:23:40.520 --> 00:23:47.480
But someday our dreams will bloom

00:23:47.820 --> 00:23:55.820
Dreams X Dreams

00:24:06.840 --> 00:24:08.340
<i>The Shadow Lord.</i>

00:24:08.920 --> 00:24:12.550
<i>The powerful, evil being
that rules the Shadowlands.</i>

00:24:12.550 --> 00:24:16.430
<i>He invaded the Kingdom of
Deltora as a brutal tyrant.</i>

00:24:16.430 --> 00:24:19.890
<i>Only the Belt of Deltora can stand against him.</i>

00:24:20.640 --> 00:24:23.970
The Shadow Lord has finally revealed himself.

00:24:23.970 --> 00:24:28.180
Can I defeat such a powerful foe?

00:24:28.180 --> 00:24:30.820
Belt of Deltora, please grant me your power!

00:24:30.860 --> 00:24:34.820
When the Seven Gems Shine

00:24:31.600 --> 00:24:34.820
Next time, 'When the Seven Gems Shine'.

00:24:49.840 --> 00:24:54.970
See you next time
